"The Enhanced engine with every 60 Hz mode on: fields (with their 20 and 15 "
"fps rooms), the world map and battles."
msgstr ""
"El motor mejorado con cada modo 60 Hz en: campos (con sus salas de 20 y 15 "
"fps), el mapa mundial y batallas."

#: port/src/ui/options.cpp port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Ejecución"

#: port/src/ui/options.cpp
msgid ""
"For integrated GPUs and handhelds: 2x resolution, the large surfaces at "
"half of it, no high-resolution pause blur (a CPU effect), no shader, HD-2D "
"effects off, motion shown at 60 Hz, and the game thread sleeping between "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"Para GPUs integrados y portátiles: resolución 2x, las superficies grandes a "
"la mitad de ella, ninguna pausa de alta resolución borrosa (un efecto CPU), "
"ningún sombreador, efectos HD-2D apagado, movimiento mostrado a 60 Hz, y el "
"hilo del juego durmiendo entre marcos."

#: port/src/ui/options.cpp
